[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0010","text":"雾子，之前拍的那些照片，\n我拿到了一些数据。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0020","text":"哇……\n我可以……看看吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0030","text":"嗯，当然可以。\n来。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0040","text":"…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0050","text":"每张都拍得很好呢……\n嗯，这张的表情特别自然。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0060","text":"谢谢你……\n那个……拍摄的时候……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0070","text":"嗯，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0080","text":"相机……好像在跟我说话一样……\n咔嚓……咔嚓地……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0090","text":"原来是这样……！\n那这张，就是听到开心的事时的表情了啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800100_03_0100","text":"呵呵……说不定……\n真的是那样呢……"}]
